{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-03-29 16:15:00', 'title': 'DOVER FUELING SOLUTIONS PARTNERS WITH EDGEPETROL', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., MARCH 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOVER (NYSE: DOV) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A COMMERCIAL PARTNERSHIP AGREEMENT WITH, AND ACQUIRED A MINORITY INTEREST IN, EDGEPETROL LIMITED ("EDGEPETROL"), AN INNOVATIVE PROVIDER OF CLOUD-BASED SOFTWARE FOR REVENUE AND OPERATING RESULTS MANAGEMENT TO THE RETAIL FUELING INDUSTRY.'}